  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We’re a professional tooling brand supplying high-quality, reliable equipment built for the demands of the trade. Our range is designed with durability, performance, and practicality in mind—tools you can depend on day in, day out, whether you’re on site, in the workshop, or on the move. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>What makes us different? </strong>We focus on no-nonsense, job-ready tools that deliver consistent performance without inflated pricing. Our products are tested in real working environments and built to last, giving tradespeople confidence in every job. Whilst looking fresh of course!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn?</strong> Affiliates earn commission on every successful referral through their unique link or coupon code. With strong conversion rates and competitive pricing, it’s a straightforward way to generate consistent returns by recommending products professionals already need.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How to promote us?</strong> Share your referral link across your social channels, website, or directly with your network. Whether it’s on-site recommendations, tool reviews, or content showing our products in action, authentic promotion works best.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We support our affiliates with reliable tracking, clear reporting, and a straightforward process from referral to payout. Built for professionals—both in the tools we make and the partnerships we offer.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
